<apex:page standardController="NOC__c" extensions="CapriNocPdfController"
           renderAs="pdf" showHeader="false" sidebar="false"
           standardStylesheets="false" applyHtmlTag="false" applyBodyTag="false">
    <html>
    <head>
        <style type="text/css">
            @page { size: A4; margin: 18mm 16mm 18mm 16mm; }
            body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #222; }
            p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.4; }
            .date { text-align: right; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(errorMessage))}"><p>{!errorMessage}</p></apex:outputPanel>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!ISBLANK(errorMessage)}">
            <p class="date"><b>Date:</b> {!TODAY()}</p>
            <p>
                Capri Global Capital Limited<br/>
                502, Tower A,<br/>
                Peninsula Business Park,<br/>
                Senapati Bapat Marg,<br/>
                Lower Parel, Mumbai 400 013.
            </p>
            <p>
                <b>Subject: Swap of Flat No:
                    <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}"/>
                    for Flat No:
                    <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}"/>
                </b>
            </p>
            <p>Dear Sir,</p>
            <p>
                With reference to the inventory list provided along with the Loan Agreement /
                Supplemental and Amendatory Loan Agreement between M/s. Capri Global Capital Limited
                and M/s. Ananda Homes dated 28-June-2024, Flat No.
                <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}"/></b> was an unsold unit
                having area <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}"/> sq. ft.
            </p>
            <p>
                The said unit was sold to
                <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Booking__r.First_Applicant_Name__c}"/></b>.
                We have received a request from the customer to swap Flat No.
                <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}"/></b>, forming part of
                unsold inventory under the aforementioned loan agreement and having area
                <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}"/> sq. ft.,
                for Flat No. <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}"/></b>,
                also forming part of the unsold inventory and having area
                <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}"/> sq. ft.,
                on account of <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Swap_Reason__c}"/>.
            </p>
            <p>
                Flat No. <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}"/></b> was
                tentatively allotted to
                <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Booking__r.First_Applicant_Name__c}"/></b>.
                We have neither entered into an Agreement for Sale nor completed registration, and
                no NOC was obtained for that flat.
            </p>
            <p>
                On account of the above swap arrangement, we confirm that Flat No.
                <b><apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}"/></b> shall form part of
                unsold inventory and shall be subject to the terms applicable to unsold inventory
                under the loan agreement.
            </p>
            <p>
                <b>Note:</b> Flat No. <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}"/>
                has been released from
                <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.Old_Booking__r.First_Applicant_Name__c}"/>
                and is allotted as a new booking to
                <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Booking__r.First_Applicant_Name__c}"/>
                <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(swapHistory.New_Booking__r.Mobile_Primary__c))}">
                    (Mobile: <apex:outputText value="{!swapHistory.New_Booking__r.Mobile_Primary__c}"/>)
                </apex:outputPanel>.
            </p>
            <p>For M/s. Ananda Homes,</p>
            <br/><br/>
            <p>Authorised Signatory</p>
        </apex:outputPanel>
    </body>
    </html>
</apex:page>